# Settings rep (pre-redesign rows): open Settings, down to Automatic window size (4 rows), turn it off, scroll to Widescreen HUD position (3 rows), change it, Esc to the save prompt.
# Key presses sit on the bed beat grid inside the take: frame = round(26.25 * beat), held 5 frames.
# The edit places take beat 0 on a bar line of the Metropolis Zone bed (105 frames per bar).
setup=hub
width=320
preroll=90
realtime-ms=8
frames=971
26 UP   # beat 1
52 RIGHT   # beat 2
79 ENTER   # beat 3
131 DOWN   # beat 5
158 DOWN   # beat 6
184 DOWN   # beat 7
210 DOWN   # beat 8
262 RIGHT   # beat 10
551 DOWN   # beat 21
578 DOWN   # beat 22
604 DOWN   # beat 23
709 RIGHT   # beat 27
814 ESC   # beat 31
